{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The power strip feels like a natural next purchase because I have several computer accessories to power and have already bought supplies to organize my cables.",
    "The cleaning cloth complements my recent electric duster: I want to maintain my equipment, and wiping screens meets a different cleaning need."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The speaker and streaming stick do not address my current setup needs; buying headphones and connection accessories does not mean I am looking for more entertainment devices.",
    "The full-size SD card does not match my recent microSD needs, while the 4TB SSD and 24-port switch assume storage and networking requirements I have not shown."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in electronics seems to have been treated as interest in almost any electronic device, even though my recent purchases mostly solve practical computer setup needs.",
    "Buying cables and memory cards seems to have been taken as a reason to offer more of them without enough attention to connector type, length, capacity, or whether I already have enough."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent five-pack of Ethernet cables and existing HDMI cable make additional cables less useful unless they solve a specific connection problem.",
    "I am interested in manageable improvements to my existing setup, but an internal SSD requires a compatibility check, and networking interest alone does not justify a 24-port switch."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my interest in maintaining and organizing a computer setup, but often miss the specific needs and existing supplies that determine what I would choose now."
}"}
